/// Ordered incremental column additions for legacy browser storage databases,
/// as `(table, column, definition)` triples. Order matters: platforms replay
/// these `ALTER TABLE … ADD COLUMN` statements in sequence, so the resulting
/// column order in `PRAGMA table_info` stays byte-identical across all
/// platforms and across upgrades from any pre-v6 schema.
///
/// Every entry must stay in lockstep with the matching column definition in
/// [`BROWSER_STORAGE_SCHEMA_STATEMENTS`]; a drift here would fork the schema
/// between freshly created and migrated databases and corrupt sync. The
/// `browser_storage_schema_migration_plan_matches_base_schema` test enforces
/// this invariant.
